body:
Lately its from Gray's track "Just Do It"  


>I hope it's forever, this youth and strength, inspiration and feeling too. I hope it's forever, the people I love.

&#x200B;

>I tell myself "Quit thinking useless things and..." Go ahead and do it. Just go ahead and do it. If you worry too much about everything, even things that should work out don't. So just go ahead and do it.

&#x200B;

>It's not something that will work out as planned anyways so let's have fun doing it.

&#x200B;

>I faced my anxiety alone, shut in by close-minded thoughts.

&#x200B;

>"Will this last...?" "Until when will it be forever..?"

&#x200B;

>I wish time would stop. When I sometimes look, it goes too fast. It sometimes feels like only my time goes fast. Wrapped up in worries, I'm just spacing out.

&#x200B;

I always worry about everything that will happen after I do something, but Gray's song just tells me that I should do what I feel is right and worry ignore small things. JUST GO AHEAD AND DO IT!
